s followed by random bits, held in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"memory only.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Export the events’ schemas and catch breaking changes in CI: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/TrackingPlanWorkflow"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Test what your code tracks: ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/TestingWhatYouTrack"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Send to logs, traces, your own server, PostHog, Amplitude, Mixpanel, Segment, RudderStack,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Customer.io, Google Analytics from a server or memory, with values for one destination alone:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/ChoosingDestinations","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Send to an analytics vendor not yet covered, from a module of your own:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/WritingAVendorDestination","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decide what belongs in an event and what stays out of it: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/WhatGoesWhere","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/IdentifyingPeople","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/PrivacyManifests","type":"refer